    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "@ NORTHWEST ORIENT",
      "NORTHWEST ORIENT's 747 (USA) — With wider\nseats for 362 passengers, 8-foot ceilings, 12 powder\nrooms, stereo, movies and a spiral staircase to a red\ncarpet lounge in first class, Northwest's Jumbo Jetliner has\nchanged the old conception of air transport.\nCruising speed: 920kph. Maximum range: 6,700 km.\nDaily flights: Tokyo -Seattle - Chicago-New York. Tokyo-\nHonolulu-San Francisco and Tokyo-Honolulu-los Angeles.\nPOST CARD\nAFFIX\nSTAMP\nHERE\n004\nNORTHWEST ORIENT 747\nNBC N\nIIPPON BEAUTY CARD\nICENTER MINCE\n8829Ix| 747 362\nCANCE\n2015,166.1158"
